    "事件钩子创建失败:请在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 输入监控”勾选本 App,然后完全退出重开。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Failed to create event tap: enable this app under System Settings › Privacy & Security › Input Monitoring, then fully quit and reopen."
