    "按下的键若未显示在此,说明系统没有把该键交给我们(常见于妙控键盘的媒体层按键)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If a pressed key never shows up here, macOS didn't route it to us (common for Magic Keyboard media-layer keys)"
