    "授权后请完全退出并重新打开本 App 才会生效。从 Xcode 运行时权限偶发不生效,建议打包导出到 /Applications 后再授权。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After granting, fully quit and reopen this app for it to take effect. Permissions can be flaky when running from Xcode — export to /Applications first."
